      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PUDDIN' TIME (1) is a handy type who notched her 2nd career success when too good (22.13) from Box 1 at this track. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. ZERO FORGING (8) quickly into stride and found the front, leading until late when second (21.85) at this track in a Grade 5 over 380m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Expected to be in this for a long way. CREEPING CLOVER (2) resumed from a break finishing eighth (22.95) at this track in a Grade 5. Will strip fitter for the run. The form from her last run stacks up well. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. RAYMAR FOX (7) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
